==English==

===Etymology===
< {{etyl|la}} {{term|machinatus}}, past participle of {{term|machinari||to contrive, plan, devise, plot, scheme}} < {{term|machina||a machine, contrivance, device, scheme}}; see [[machine]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb|machinat|ing}}

# (''transitive'' or ''intransitive'') To [[devise]], with others, a [[plot]] or [[secret]] [[plan]]; to [[conspire]].

